# Boxcar Studio reads no settings from its environment.
#
# There is no account, no server and no SITE_URL. Everything is stored on the
# author's computer. The author's own AI key (OpenAI or Anthropic) is typed into
# the app under Settings and kept in local storage, never in a .env file.
#
# If a setting is ever added, list its name here with a comment and no value.
